<title>UK: Province of New Brunswick sets C$200 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Province of New Brunswick sets C$200 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager RBC Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEW BRUNSWICK, PROVINCE OF</p>
<p> AMT    C$200 MLN     COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    26.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.555   PAY DATE    26.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.88     SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
